1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,261
很多上下文，其实不在代码库里：
A lot of your context lives outside your codebase:

2
00:00:02,281 --> 00:00:04,980
在数据库、协作软件、公开仓库里。
in databases, productivity apps, public repos.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,105
MCP，模型上下文协议，就是
MCP, the Model Context Protocol,

4
00:00:07,125 --> 00:00:10,210
把外部工具接进 Claude Code 的桥。
is the bridge that connects those tools to Claude Code.

5
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:12,178
团队用 Linear 管项目？
If your team tracks work in Linear, add

6
00:00:12,198 --> 00:00:15,340
加个 MCP 服务器，就能直接读工单。
a Linear MCP server and Claude can read the issues itself.

7
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,944
要查依赖的最新文档，
Need up-to-date docs for a dependency?

8
00:00:16,964 --> 00:00:19,570
有 Context7 这类文档服务器。
A docs server like Context7 can provide them.

9
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:21,789
用 claude mcp add 添加，
Add a server with claude mcp add. The two common types:

10
00:00:21,809 --> 00:00:24,540
常用 HTTP 和 stdio 两种。
HTTP for remote services, stdio for local processes.

11
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:27,051
会话里敲 /mcp，能看连接状态，
Inside a session, /mcp shows what's connected and lets

12
00:00:27,071 --> 00:00:29,920
不用的直接关掉，配置不会丢。
you disable what you don't need, keeping its config.

13
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:31,414
范围有三档：本地，
There are three scopes:

14
00:00:31,434 --> 00:00:33,240
只有你、只在这个项目；
local, just you in this project;

15
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:35,080
用户，你的所有项目。
user, across all your projects.

16
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,266
第三档是项目：
The third is project:

17
00:00:36,286 --> 00:00:38,637
写进 .mcp.json 提交进版本库，
a .mcp.json checked into version control,

18
00:00:38,657 --> 00:00:40,900
全队拿到同一套服务器。
so everyone gets the same servers.

19
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,148
要记住代价：每个服务器的工具
Mind the cost: each server's tool names

20
00:00:43,168 --> 00:00:45,396
名和说明，每个会话都要载入，
and instructions load every session

21
00:00:45,416 --> 00:00:47,080
会占一点上下文。
and take a little context.

22
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,956
有现成命令行的，比如 gh、aws，
If a CLI exists, like gh or aws, it's more context-efficient.

23
00:00:49,976 --> 00:00:53,290
更省；技能管怎么用，和 MCP 互补。
Skills teach how to use tools, and complement MCP.

24
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:55,568
默认只先放工具名，用到才加载。
By default only tool names load first, and the rest on demand.

25
00:00:55,588 --> 00:00:58,330
用第三方中转的，默认可能是关着的。
Behind a third-party gateway, that default may be off.

26
00:00:58,350 --> 00:01:00,230
多接一个，就多占一点上下文，
Every server you add costs a little context.

27
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:01,750
不用的，关掉。
Disable the ones you don't use.
